1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,585
Nineteen eighty one.

2
00:00:01,805 --> 00:00:07,649
A twelve year old boy is playing in his grandmother's backyard in Centralia, Pennsylvania.

3
00:00:08,149 --> 00:00:10,172
And the ground opens under his feet.

4
00:00:11,572 --> 00:00:15,769
He falls into a hole full of hot steam and grabs onto tree roots.

5
00:00:15,989 --> 00:00:17,357
His cousin pulls him out.

6
00:00:17,577 --> 00:00:18,534
He survives.

7
00:00:19,034 --> 00:00:20,292
Then they test the steam.

8
00:00:20,512 --> 00:00:22,704
It's full of deadly carbon monoxide.

9
00:00:23,204 --> 00:00:28,553
Because under that backyard, a coal mine fire had been burning for nearly twenty years.

10
00:00:29,953 --> 00:00:30,860
And that fire?

11
00:00:31,080 --> 00:00:32,527
It's still burning today.

12
00:00:33,027 --> 00:00:37,713
How it started, and what happened to the town, is in the full story on the channel.

13
00:00:37,933 --> 00:00:39,252
Tap the video above.
